Description: Skip test fonts copy in Chromium build for Debian
 Test fonts are stripped from the Debian Chromium source tarball to reduce
 package size. These 90+ font files are used exclusively for browser testing
 and are not required for CEF package functionality.
 .
 This patch replaces the copy() target with an empty group() target, which
 satisfies build dependencies without requiring the font files.
 .
 The test_fonts are referenced by Skia's BUILD.gn but are not needed for
 CEF builds or runtime functionality.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <vejeta@gmail.com>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2025-11-16

